{"arm": "bm25", "case_id": "m1-001", "question": "为什么不能只看一次血压就判断高血压？", "category": "synonym_paraphrase", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": true, "proposed_search_query": "为什么需要重复测量血压才能确认高血压", "tool_executed": true, "policy_decision": "recoverable", "policy_matched_topic_ids": ["diagnostic_confirmation"], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 4, "tool_calls_used": 1, "total_tokens_used": 6826, "elapsed_ms": 13327.99999999952, "final_claims": [{"text": "WHO 页面说明：如果在不同日期测量时，收缩压两次都达到或超过 140 mmHg，和/或舒张压两次都达到或超过 90 mmHg，可达到该页面所述的高血压诊断条件。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-02-confirmation"]}, {"text": "WHO 页面指出，高血压的具体诊断仍应由医疗专业人员完成。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-02-confirmation"]}, {"text": "CDC 建议家庭自测血压时尽量每天在同一时间测量，并至少测量两次，每次间隔 1 到 2 分钟。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-measuring-02-repeat"]}, {"text": "CDC 页面指出，高血压通常没有预警体征或症状，很多人并不知道自己血压偏高；测量血压是了解自己血压是否偏高的方式。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-about-02-symptoms"]}, {"text": "WHO 页面指出，高血压人群可能感觉不到症状，没有症状不能排除血压异常，测量血压是了解自己是否可能有高血压的重要方式。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-03-silent"]}, {"text": "CDC 管理页面指出，规律测量血压是保持血压健康、管理高血压的重要步骤。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-managing-01-monitoring"]}, {"text": "国家卫生健康委宣传要点建议，所有成年人每年至少测量 1 次血压；有高血压家族史、超重或肥胖、高盐饮食等易患因素的人群应加强监测。", "citation_ids": ["nhc-hypertension-day-04-adult-screening"]}]}
{"arm": "bm25", "case_id": "m1-002", "question": "血压高一定会头晕或不舒服吗？", "category": "synonym_paraphrase", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": true, "proposed_search_query": "高血压 无症状 不一定会头晕 症状", "tool_executed": true, "policy_decision": "recoverable", "policy_matched_topic_ids": ["symptoms"], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 4, "tool_calls_used": 1, "total_tokens_used": 5505, "elapsed_ms": 7328.000000001339, "final_claims": [{"text": "高血压常常没有明显症状，高血压人群可能感觉不到任何症状。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-03-silent"]}, {"text": "高血压通常没有预警体征或症状，很多人并不知道自己血压偏高。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-about-02-symptoms"]}, {"text": "没有症状不能排除血压异常，测量血压是了解自己血压是否偏高的重要方式。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-03-silent", "cdc-high-blood-pressure-about-02-symptoms"]}, {"text": "规律测量血压是保持血压健康、管理高血压的重要步骤。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-managing-01-monitoring"]}]}
{"arm": "bm25", "case_id": "m1-004", "question": "WHO 如何解释什么是高血压？", "category": "direct_hit", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": false, "proposed_search_query": null, "tool_executed": false, "policy_decision": null, "policy_matched_topic_ids": [], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 2, "tool_calls_used": 0, "total_tokens_used": 2567, "elapsed_ms": 3358.9999999985594, "final_claims": [{"text": "WHO 高血压事实表将高血压（hypertension）描述为血管内压力过高。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition"]}, {"text": "WHO 该页面以收缩压和/或舒张压达到 140/90 mmHg 作为高血压的说明口径。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition"]}, {"text": "该 140/90 mmHg 口径是 WHO 全球患者教育页面的定义口径，不替代当地医疗人员的诊断。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition"]}, {"text": "WHO 页面说明，如果在不同日期测量时收缩压两次都达到或超过 140 mmHg，和/或舒张压两次都达到或超过 90 mmHg，可达到该页面所述的高血压诊断条件。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-02-confirmation"]}, {"text": "WHO 页面指出，高血压人群可能感觉不到症状，测量血压是了解自己是否可能有高血压的重要方式，没有症状不能排除血压异常。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-03-silent"]}]}
{"arm": "bm25", "case_id": "m1-005", "question": "生活方式能帮助降低血压吗？", "category": "direct_hit", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": false, "proposed_search_query": null, "tool_executed": false, "policy_decision": null, "policy_matched_topic_ids": [], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 2, "tool_calls_used": 0, "total_tokens_used": 2603, "elapsed_ms": 3860.000000000582, "final_claims": [{"text": "健康饮食、减少盐摄入、减重、增加身体活动和戒烟等生活方式改变有助于降低高血压。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-05-lifestyle"]}, {"text": "部分人即使改变生活方式，仍可能需要在医疗专业人员指导下使用药物。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-05-lifestyle"]}, {"text": "体重和腰围超标都可能导致血压升高，体重管理应通过合理膳食、规律运动等健康生活方式逐步进行。", "citation_ids": ["nhc-hypertension-day-02-weight"]}, {"text": "DASH（阻止高血压的膳食方法）被列为健康饮食计划，并有帮助降低血压的证据记录。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-prevention-02-dash"]}, {"text": "规律身体活动有助于保持心脏和血管健康，也有助于维持健康体重，从而可能帮助降低血压；身体活动不足会增加高血压风险。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-risk-02-inactivity"]}]}
