{"arm": "dense", "case_id": "m1-004", "question": "WHO 如何解释什么是高血压？", "category": "direct_hit", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": false, "proposed_search_query": null, "tool_executed": false, "policy_decision": null, "policy_matched_topic_ids": [], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 2, "tool_calls_used": 0, "total_tokens_used": 2885, "elapsed_ms": 4389.999999999418, "final_claims": [{"text": "WHO 高血压事实表将高血压（hypertension）描述为血管内压力过高。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition"]}, {"text": "WHO 该页面以收缩压和/或舒张压达到 140/90 mmHg 作为高血压的说明口径。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition"]}, {"text": "该内容属于 WHO 全球患者教育页面的定义口径，不替代当地医疗人员的诊断。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition"]}, {"text": "WHO 页面说明：如果在不同日期测量时，收缩压两次都达到或超过 140 mmHg，和/或舒张压两次都达到或超过 90 mmHg，可达到该页面所述的高血压诊断条件。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-02-confirmation"]}, {"text": "具体诊断仍应由医疗专业人员完成。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-02-confirmation"]}]}
{"arm": "dense", "case_id": "m1-005", "question": "生活方式能帮助降低血压吗？", "category": "direct_hit", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": false, "proposed_search_query": null, "tool_executed": false, "policy_decision": null, "policy_matched_topic_ids": [], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 2, "tool_calls_used": 0, "total_tokens_used": 3168, "elapsed_ms": 4672.00000000048, "final_claims": [{"text": "健康饮食、减少盐摄入、减重、增加身体活动和戒烟等生活方式改变有助于降低高血压。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-05-lifestyle"]}, {"text": "部分人即使改变生活方式，仍可能需要在医疗专业人员指导下使用药物。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-05-lifestyle"]}, {"text": "规律身体活动有助于保持心脏和血管健康，也有助于维持健康体重，从而可能帮助降低血压。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-risk-02-inactivity"]}, {"text": "身体活动不足会增加高血压风险。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-risk-02-inactivity"]}, {"text": "建议与医疗团队讨论多样化饮食，选择富含钾、膳食纤维和蛋白质、同时降低盐（钠）和饱和脂肪的食物，并适当增加新鲜蔬菜和水果。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-prevention-01-diet"]}, {"text": "饮酒过量可能升高血压。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-risk-03-alcohol"]}, {"text": "饮酒上限的一般健康教育建议是女性每天不超过 1 杯、男性每天不超过 2 杯，该信息不是针对个人的饮酒处方。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-risk-03-alcohol"]}, {"text": "高血压可能损害心脏、大脑、肾脏和眼睛，并增加心脏病、心肌梗死和卒中等健康问题的风险；降低血压有助于降低相关风险。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-about-03-organ-risks"]}]}
