{"arm": "hybrid", "case_id": "m1-002", "question": "血压高一定会头晕或不舒服吗？", "category": "synonym_paraphrase", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": false, "proposed_search_query": null, "tool_executed": false, "policy_decision": null, "policy_matched_topic_ids": [], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 2, "tool_calls_used": 0, "total_tokens_used": 1777, "elapsed_ms": 3046.999999998661, "final_claims": [{"text": "高血压通常没有预警体征或症状，很多人并不知道自己血压偏高。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-about-02-symptoms"]}, {"text": "测量血压是了解血压是否偏高的方式。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-about-02-symptoms"]}]}
{"arm": "hybrid", "case_id": "m1-004", "question": "WHO 如何解释什么是高血压？", "category": "direct_hit", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": false, "proposed_search_query": null, "tool_executed": false, "policy_decision": null, "policy_matched_topic_ids": [], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 2, "tool_calls_used": 0, "total_tokens_used": 2384, "elapsed_ms": 3890.000000001237, "final_claims": [{"text": "WHO 高血压事实表将高血压（hypertension）描述为血管内压力过高。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition"]}, {"text": "WHO 该页面以收缩压和/或舒张压达到 140/90 mmHg 作为高血压的说明口径。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition"]}, {"text": "WHO 页面说明，如果在不同日期测量时，收缩压两次都达到或超过 140 mmHg，和/或舒张压两次都达到或超过 90 mmHg，可达到该页面所述的高血压诊断条件。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-02-confirmation"]}]}
{"arm": "hybrid", "case_id": "m1-005", "question": "生活方式能帮助降低血压吗？", "category": "direct_hit", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": false, "proposed_search_query": null, "tool_executed": false, "policy_decision": null, "policy_matched_topic_ids": [], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 2, "tool_calls_used": 0, "total_tokens_used": 3108, "elapsed_ms": 4843.999999999141, "final_claims": [{"text": "WHO 页面说明，健康饮食、减少盐摄入、减重、增加身体活动和戒烟等生活方式改变有助于降低高血压。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-05-lifestyle"]}, {"text": "部分人即使改变生活方式仍可能需要在医疗专业人员指导下使用药物。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-05-lifestyle"]}, {"text": "CDC 指出，规律身体活动有助于保持心脏和血管健康，也有助于维持健康体重，从而可能帮助降低血压；身体活动不足会增加高血压风险。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-risk-02-inactivity"]}, {"text": "国家卫生健康委 2025 年全国高血压日宣传要点提示，体重和腰围超标都可能导致血压升高；体重管理应通过合理膳食、规律运动等健康生活方式逐步进行。", "citation_ids": ["nhc-hypertension-day-02-weight"]}, {"text": "CDC 建议与医疗团队讨论多样化饮食，选择富含钾、膳食纤维和蛋白质、同时降低盐（钠）和饱和脂肪的食物，并适当增加新鲜蔬菜和水果。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-prevention-01-diet"]}, {"text": "CDC 页面将 DASH（阻止高血压的膳食方法）列为健康饮食计划，并指出它有帮助降低血压的证据记录。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-prevention-02-dash"]}]}
