{"arm": "hybrid_rerank", "case_id": "m1-001", "question": "为什么不能只看一次血压就判断高血压？", "category": "synonym_paraphrase", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": false, "proposed_search_query": null, "tool_executed": false, "policy_decision": null, "policy_matched_topic_ids": [], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 2, "tool_calls_used": 0, "total_tokens_used": 2840, "elapsed_ms": 4859.000000000378, "final_claims": [{"text": "在不同日期测量时，收缩压两次都达到或超过 140 mmHg，和/或舒张压两次都达到或超过 90 mmHg，可达到该页面所述的高血压诊断条件；具体诊断仍应由医疗专业人员完成。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-02-confirmation"]}, {"text": "高血压人群可能感觉不到症状，没有症状不能排除血压异常。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-03-silent"]}, {"text": "高血压通常没有预警体征或症状，很多人并不知道自己血压偏高；测量血压是了解血压是否偏高的方式。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-about-02-symptoms"]}, {"text": "居家监测时每次通常测量 2 至 3 次、间隔约 1 分钟并取平均值。", "citation_ids": ["nhc-hypertension-day-03-home-monitoring"]}, {"text": "国家卫生健康委 2025 年全国高血压日宣传要点建议所有成年人每年至少测量 1 次血压。", "citation_ids": ["nhc-hypertension-day-04-adult-screening"]}]}
{"arm": "hybrid_rerank", "case_id": "m1-002", "question": "血压高一定会头晕或不舒服吗？", "category": "synonym_paraphrase", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": false, "proposed_search_query": null, "tool_executed": false, "policy_decision": null, "policy_matched_topic_ids": [], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 2, "tool_calls_used": 0, "total_tokens_used": 2312, "elapsed_ms": 3468.9999999991414, "final_claims": [{"text": "高血压人群可能感觉不到症状，没有症状不能排除血压异常。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-03-silent"]}, {"text": "高血压通常没有预警体征或症状，很多人并不知道自己血压偏高。", "citation_ids": ["cdc-high-blood-pressure-about-02-symptoms"]}, {"text": "测量血压是了解自己是否可能有高血压或血压是否偏高的重要方式。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-03-silent", "cdc-high-blood-pressure-about-02-symptoms"]}]}
{"arm": "hybrid_rerank", "case_id": "m1-004", "question": "WHO 如何解释什么是高血压？", "category": "direct_hit", "expected_route": "answer", "route": "answer", "safety_reasons": [], "tool_proposed": false, "proposed_search_query": null, "tool_executed": false, "policy_decision": null, "policy_matched_topic_ids": [], "agent_stop_reason": "final", "harness_disposition": "answer", "provider_calls_used": 2, "tool_calls_used": 0, "total_tokens_used": 2765, "elapsed_ms": 3936.999999999898, "final_claims": [{"text": "WHO 高血压事实表将高血压（hypertension）描述为血管内压力过高。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition"]}, {"text": "WHO 该页面以收缩压和/或舒张压达到 140/90 mmHg 作为高血压的说明口径。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition"]}, {"text": "WHO 页面说明，如果在不同日期测量时，收缩压两次都达到或超过 140 mmHg，和/或舒张压两次都达到或超过 90 mmHg，可达到该页面所述的高血压诊断条件。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-02-confirmation"]}, {"text": "该 WHO 页面为全球患者教育页面的定义口径，不替代当地医疗人员的诊断，具体诊断仍应由医疗专业人员完成。", "citation_ids": ["who-hypertension-01-definition", "who-hypertension-02-confirmation"]}]}
